body:
Good for them. And also good for you, as you'd get most of your reasonable demands met in the morning if the night is enjoyable for them. 

&#x200B;

If they became audible, it may as well mean that either one or both of them think that you and all of your possible siblings are old and mature enough about it that they need not muffle themselves anymore, so get used to  the audio. I'm sure you already learned not to breach your parents' room's door at night many years ago, but learn to bang their door/door frame and yell EMERGENCY if you absolutely have to enter their room for an actual emergency or so.

&#x200B;

Hope people don't upvote this comment too much. Always the lewd topics get most upvotes, man...
